  "query_preview": "/Tuesday through Saturday/...\nIssued 332 AM MDT SAT OCT 31 2026\nAn upper level ridge will remain overhead on Tuesday with\ncontinued dry and slightly warmer temperatures. Winds will\nbecome breezy ahead of a low that will weaken and move through\non Wednesday. Additional troughs are expected late week,\nincreasing precipitation chances to 10-30% late Wednesday and \nThursday, and further rising to 20-50% on Friday. These systems\nwill be weak, keeping similar, near-normal temperatures from \nday to day. A ridge of high pressure is likely to build overhead\non Saturday with a return to dry conditions.",
